</head>
<body data-time="future" class="tab-future">
  <header class="site"><div class="wrap bar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">Vault <b>Human</b></a>
    <nav class="navlinks"><a href="/#how">How it works</a><a href="/method/">The method</a><a href="/#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="/#russ">About Russ</a><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start free</a></nav>
  </div></header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero hero-video"><video class="bgvid" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="/video/desert-night-poster.jpg"><source src="/video/desert-night.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="veil"></div>
      <div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past">Past</span><span class="tw present">Present</span><span class="tw future on">Future</span></div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Life, as lived</p>
        <h1>What you'll <em>leave behind.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Not just money. A way of living that outlasts you. The last rooms of the year are about tomorrow, and about serving someone other than yourself.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start free — 7 days of lessons</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#who">Who this is for</a></div>
        <p class="guarantee">Seven free days from this part of the year. Then $97 a month. Cancel any time.</p>
      </div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="sec gallery-sec faces"><div class="wrap gallery"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511895426328-dc8714191300?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A family walking on the beach at sunset" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Who it is for</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/img/russ/strip/horizon.jpg" alt="Russ facing the sunset on the beach, arms raised" style="object-position:50% 62%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The long view</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1475483768296-6163e08872a1?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Grandparents with a grandchild" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>What you leave</figcaption></figure></div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="what"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">What we look at</p><h2>The things you'll be remembered for.</h2><p class="lede">Legacy, purpose, the people who come after you, and the documents that protect them.</p></div>
      <div class="pains"><div class="pain"><h3>Your plan</h3><p>A will, a trust, a health directive. The three documents every adult needs, and most never sign.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Your purpose</h3><p>A reason you can say out loud. We help you write it and then live by it.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Your people</h3><p>Who you serve, who you teach, who you hand things to. Tomorrow is about them.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="who"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Who this is for</p><h2>Three kinds of people start here.</h2></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Individuals</h3><p>You've reached the point where it matters what you leave, not just what you earn.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Business owners</h3><p>Who runs the company if you can't? Succession is a plan, not a hope.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Families</h3><p>You want your parents' wishes known, or your kids' future protected, before it's urgent.</p></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">Every path starts the same way: seven free days of lessons, then $97 a month, then a 30-minute call with Russ. <a href="/#pricing">See pricing.</a></p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec"><div class="wrap gallery"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543342384-1f1350e27861?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="New parents holding their newborn" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The ones who come after</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559027615-cd4628902d4a?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A volunteer at a community event" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Serving</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/img/russ/strip/action.jpg" alt="Russ playing catch on a lawn" style="object-position:45% 58%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Leaving it better</figcaption></figure></div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="russ-as-lived"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Russ, as lived</p><h2>How I live it.</h2></div><div class="lgrid tall wide"><figure class="big"><video  style="--p:50% 30%;--pm:50% 22%" class="fg" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/img/russ/v2/lived-parasail-poster.jpg" aria-label="A parasail flying over open water behind a boat"><source src="/img/russ/v2/lived-parasail.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></figure><figure class=""><img style="--p:50% 50%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/lived-como-boat.jpg" alt="Russ driving a boat on Lake Como" width="1400" height="788" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure class=""><img style="--p:50% 50%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/lived-machu.jpg" alt="Machu Picchu above the clouds" width="1280" height="964" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure class=""><img style="--p:50% 50%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/lived-stadium.jpg" alt="The Olympic stadium in Paris" width="1400" height="1050" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure class=""><img  style="--p:50% 50%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/lived-grill.jpg" alt="A spread of grilled food on the counter" width="1400" height="788" loading="lazy" /></figure></div>
    </div></section>
<style is:global>
  .lgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));grid-auto-rows:230px;gap:14px}
  .lgrid figure{margin:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;background:#0d0f0d}
  .lgrid .big{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2}
  .lgrid.tall .big{grid-column:span 1}
    .lgrid .fg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:var(--p,50% 50%)}
  @media(max-width:760px){.lgrid .fg{object-position:var(--pm,var(--p,50% 50%))}.lgrid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));grid-auto-rows:170px;gap:10px}.lgrid .big,.lgrid.tall .big{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2}.lgrid:not(.tall) .big{grid-row:span 1}.lgrid:not(.tall) figure:last-child{grid-column:span 2}}
  .lgrid.wide{grid-auto-rows:200px}
  @media(max-width:760px){.lgrid.wide{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-auto-rows:200px}.lgrid.wide .big{grid-column:span 1}}
</style>
<script is:inline>document.querySelectorAll(".lgrid video.slow").forEach(function(v){v.playbackRate=0.5;v.addEventListener("loadedmetadata",function(){v.playbackRate=0.5;});});</script>
    <section class="sec dark" id="company"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">The documents</p><h2>Need the actual will, trust, or succession plan?</h2><p class="lede">That is legal work, and Tercet Law does it at flat fees: wills, trusts, health directives, powers of attorney and business succession. Based in Austin; Alabama licensed with Texas admission pending. It is a law firm, not coaching, and never required for coaching.</p></div>
      <div class="ctarow" style="justify-content:center"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="https://www.tercetlaw.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Yes, I need the documents ↗</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#" data-open-form>No, I want coaching</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final vid-sec" id="begin"><video class="bgvid" autoplay muted loop playsinline><source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/6734/6734-720.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap">
      <h2>Start with the future.</h2><p class="lede">Sign up tonight. Your first lesson is in your inbox at 7 a.m.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start free — 7 days</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="/#pricing">See pricing</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>
  <footer class="site"><div class="wrap foot">
    <div><a class="brand" href="/">Vault <b>Human</b></a><p>Daily coaching. $97 a month.</p><p><a href="mailto:vault@vaulthuman.com">vault@vaulthuman.com</a> · <a href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></p></div>
    <ul><li><a href="/as-learned/">As Learned · the past</a></li><li><a href="/as-loved/">As Loved · the present</a></li><li><a href="/as-lived/">As Lived · the future</a></li><li><a href="/#pricing">Pricing</a></li><li><a href="/writing">Writing</a></li></ul>
    <ul><li><a href="https://www.fretworksystems.com">Fretwork Systems</a> — automation for businesses</li><li><a href="https://triplicityadvisory.com">Triplicity Advisory</a> — executive and leadership coaching</li><li><a href="https://www.tercetlaw.com">Tercet Law</a> — wills, trusts, succession</li></ul>
  </div><div class="wrap legal"><span>&copy; {year} Vault Human, LLC. Coaching is not legal, medical, financial or therapeutic advice.</span><span>Learn · Love · Live · Listen</span></div></footer>
  <div id="vh-modal" class="vh-modal" aria-hidden="true"><div class="vh-modal__bg" data-close-form></div><div class="vh-modal__card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Start with the Keys"><button class="vh-modal__x" type="button" data-close-form aria-label="Close">&times;</button><h2 class="vh-modal__title">Start free. Seven days of lessons.</h2><p class="vh-modal__sub">A real person replies within the minute with your first lesson. No card needed.</p><div class="hs-form-frame" data-region="na2" data-form-id="3f225ab5-5a70-46d9-a497-29e6256b1e52" data-portal-id="246947446"></div></div></div>
  <script is:inline src="https://js-na2.hsforms.net/forms/embed/246947446.js" defer></script>
  <script is:inline>
  (function(){var m=document.getElementById('vh-modal');if(!m)return;function o(e){if(e)e.preventDefault();m.classList.add('is-open');m.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');document.documentElement.style.overflow='hidden';}function c(){m.classList.remove('is-open');m.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');document.documentElement.style.overflow='';}document.addEventListener('click',function(e){var t=e.target.closest('[data-open-form]');if(t){o(e);return;}if(e.target.closest('[data-close-form]'))c();});document.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){if(e.key==='Escape')c();});})();
  addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',function(){document.body.classList.add('ready');if(!('IntersectionObserver'in window))return;var e=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.sec .wrap > *'));e.forEach(function(x){x.classList.add('reveal')});var o=new IntersectionObserver(function(t){t.forEach(function(y){if(y.isIntersecting){y.target.classList.add('in');o.unobserve(y.target)}})},{threshold:0.08,rootMargin:'0px 0px -30px 0px'});e.forEach(function(x){o.observe(x)});});
  </script>
  <div class="stickybar" id="stickybar"><span>7 free days of coaching. No card.</span><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start free</a></div>
  <script is:inline>
  (function(){var sb=document.getElementById('stickybar');if(sb){document.body.classList.add('has-sticky');setTimeout(function(){sb.classList.add('on')},6000);}
  var shown=false;try{shown=!!sessionStorage.getItem('vhpop')}catch(e){}
  function pop(){if(shown)return;shown=true;try{sessionStorage.setItem('vhpop','1')}catch(e){}var m=document.getElementById('vh-modal');if(m&&!m.classList.contains('is-open')){m.classList.add('is-open');m.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');}}
  document.addEventListener('mouseout',function(e){if(!e.relatedTarget&&e.clientY<=0)pop();});
  if(matchMedia('(max-width:760px)').matches)setTimeout(pop,45000);})();
  </script>
  <script is:inline>document.querySelectorAll("video.bgvid").forEach(function(v){v.playbackRate=0.6;v.addEventListener("loadedmetadata",function(){v.playbackRate=0.6;});});</script>
</body></html>
